WEBVTT

00:00:51.950 --> 00:00:58.090
Before I knew it, I abandoned happiness to survive

00:00:58.780 --> 00:01:05.250
Lying to myself, I danced clinging on to illusions

00:01:06.030 --> 00:01:11.910
At the edge of my vision when I close my eyes

00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:17.870
I was searching for your smile

00:01:18.770 --> 00:01:25.240
With our memories fading

00:01:25.780 --> 00:01:32.320
We hold on to our dreams and run  Yeah

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:39.220
These feelings that I shut away in my heart

00:01:39.760 --> 00:01:46.450
I'll now grasp them again

00:02:09.170 --> 00:02:14.850
Nameless Dragon Timaeus

00:02:18.260 --> 00:02:22.220
Yugi-  No, I mean Nameless Pharaoh.

00:02:22.220 --> 00:02:25.310
Seeing this tablet confirms it.

00:02:25.310 --> 00:02:32.460
You're the only one who can fight against the threat of mankind's extinction.

00:02:32.460 --> 00:02:34.930
Mankind's extinction?

00:02:34.930 --> 00:02:37.940
What do you mean, Professor?

00:02:38.280 --> 00:02:46.940
I've told you that I study ancient Egyptian tablets, the source of Duel Monsters.

00:02:46.970 --> 00:02:52.280
I learned that rulers used magic to seal evil inside tablets.

00:02:52.280 --> 00:03:00.730
Then they released them from their tablets as monsters to govern the people.

00:03:00.960 --> 00:03:03.360
Isn't that a Shadow Game?

00:03:03.960 --> 00:03:10.540
Some who used the tablets became possessed by the evil, gaining evil power.

00:03:10.540 --> 00:03:15.900
They gained enough power to destroy the world.

00:03:16.860 --> 00:03:20.880
The Nameless Pharaoh fought against this evil power.

00:03:21.340 --> 00:03:25.080
My other self had to deal with this?

00:03:25.820 --> 00:03:28.220
But that was long ago.

00:03:28.220 --> 00:03:30.890
What does it have to do with now?

00:03:31.260 --> 00:03:37.900
I've been researching underwater ruins in the Atlantic Ocean off the U.S. coast.

00:03:38.120 --> 00:03:40.570
I heard about that on the news.

00:03:40.570 --> 00:03:42.110
Huh?  Really?

00:03:42.110 --> 00:03:47.240
Yes.  I've studied ruins around the world.

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:50.040
But what I saw there...

00:03:50.800 --> 00:03:55.650
It was a civilization I've never seen before.

00:03:56.750 --> 00:03:58.080
Look at this.

00:03:59.390 --> 00:04:02.090
This is a Duel Monster!

00:04:04.330 --> 00:04:09.110
The pictures in the mural are similar to Duel Monsters.

00:04:09.110 --> 00:04:12.100
But they're older than the Egyptian ruins.

00:04:12.730 --> 00:04:15.600
We estimate they're over 10,000 years old.

00:04:15.600 --> 00:04:17.100
10,000 years?

00:04:17.320 --> 00:04:22.110
If that's true, this discovery will rewrite history!

00:04:22.700 --> 00:04:25.110
There's more to this mural.

00:04:27.770 --> 00:04:29.050
This is...

00:04:29.400 --> 00:04:31.620
A monster is attacking the city!

00:04:32.110 --> 00:04:37.620
That mural depicts how a monster destroyed their civilization.

00:04:38.170 --> 00:04:39.520
A monster...

00:04:40.820 --> 00:04:45.630
The monsters appearing worldwide are an omen for annihilation?

00:04:47.330 --> 00:04:49.400
The omen has begun.

00:04:49.400 --> 00:04:52.570
The world will soon end.

00:04:52.840 --> 00:04:56.170
This is what they were talking about!

00:04:56.540 --> 00:05:03.700
This 10,000 year-old mural... Egypt 3,000 years ago... What's going on now.

00:05:03.700 --> 00:05:06.950
Is it mere coincidence?  Or...

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:08.980
Wait a minute!

00:05:08.980 --> 00:05:12.460
Duel Monsters is just a game that Pegasus created.

00:05:12.460 --> 00:05:17.340
Maybe someone is messing around, using a Duel Disk to create the monsters.

00:05:17.340 --> 00:05:20.770
But Kaiba said it wasn't Solid Vision.

00:05:20.770 --> 00:05:25.800
Anzu, you think monsters are real?

00:05:26.120 --> 00:05:27.790
Well...

00:05:27.790 --> 00:05:29.690
Monsters are real.

00:05:31.040 --> 00:05:38.440
In many ancient ruins and murals, we see strange gods, incantations, magic and sorcery.

00:05:38.440 --> 00:05:48.260
I think they prove that people were calling monsters from other worlds to use their power.

00:05:49.050 --> 00:05:52.130
C'mon!  Stop joking!

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:54.710
What are you doing?

00:05:54.710 --> 00:05:57.770
How dare you!  You think my grandpa is lying?

00:05:57.770 --> 00:06:04.270
Even Pegasus was inspired by ancient Egyptian tablets to create Duel Monsters!

00:06:04.800 --> 00:06:06.620
But...

00:06:06.620 --> 00:06:08.160
It's fine, Rebecca.

00:06:08.590 --> 00:06:12.560
Even academic circles laugh at my theory.

00:06:12.560 --> 00:06:13.880
Grandpa...

00:06:14.910 --> 00:06:17.530
I believe you, Professor Hopkins.

00:06:18.160 --> 00:06:19.290
Jonouchi!

00:06:19.290 --> 00:06:23.940
Marik's Shadow Game and God Card during Battle City...

00:06:23.940 --> 00:06:29.650
Since I took Ra's attack, I know it wasn't Solid Vision.

00:06:29.650 --> 00:06:34.870
And only the chosen ones can use God Cards.

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:38.310
There may be a world that we know nothing about.

00:06:38.900 --> 00:06:41.540
The world of Duel Monsters.

00:06:41.540 --> 00:06:44.680
It may sound like a fairy tale...

00:06:44.680 --> 00:06:48.800
...but it's weirder to think that our world is the only one that exists.

00:06:48.800 --> 00:06:55.650
Some theories say that there are universes beyond time, space or dimensions.

00:06:55.650 --> 00:06:59.770
You know a lot for a kid.

00:07:00.160 --> 00:07:03.670
How rude!  I'm a college student!

00:07:03.670 --> 00:07:05.100
College?

00:07:05.520 --> 00:07:07.580
She's special.

00:07:08.130 --> 00:07:11.110
I told you I was a genius.

00:07:11.110 --> 00:07:14.110
A genius.  Ge-ni-us.

00:07:14.500 --> 00:07:17.110
She has no charm.

00:07:17.320 --> 00:07:19.140
What?

00:07:19.140 --> 00:07:20.870
Stop it, Rebecca.

00:07:20.870 --> 00:07:22.440
Aren't you a lady now?

00:07:22.440 --> 00:07:24.150
E-Excuse me.

00:07:24.960 --> 00:07:31.840
In ancient Egypt, Duel Monsters may have been destroying the world.

00:07:31.840 --> 00:07:38.040
But it didn't happen because the Nameless Pharaoh was there.

00:07:38.720 --> 00:07:45.240
There must be a reason why you've shown up in this era.

00:07:45.800 --> 00:07:50.480
That reminds me.  Doma's Three Musketeers said...

00:07:50.480 --> 00:07:53.000
When the forbidden door opens...

00:07:53.000 --> 00:07:57.250
...Orichalcos's light will judge the tainted world.

00:07:57.250 --> 00:07:59.820
We are Doma's Three Musketeers.

00:08:00.490 --> 00:08:02.830
Who are they?

00:08:04.890 --> 00:08:08.060
Professor, I want to show you something.

00:08:11.620 --> 00:08:13.070
It's pretty.

00:08:13.480 --> 00:08:15.370
Yugi, what is this?

00:08:15.370 --> 00:08:19.380
The guys who attacked us yesterday left it behind.

00:08:20.820 --> 00:08:26.510
It looks similar to the gems in the underwater ruins.

00:08:31.610 --> 00:08:34.190
Can I examine this?

00:08:34.400 --> 00:08:36.190
Sure.  Please do so.

00:08:36.460 --> 00:08:42.000
I must return to America and continue researching the underwater ruins.

00:08:42.240 --> 00:08:44.700
I'll call you if I learn anything.

00:08:46.520 --> 00:08:50.000
I'm taking Arthur and Rebecca to the airport.

00:08:51.550 --> 00:08:53.200
Until next time, darling!

00:08:56.220 --> 00:08:57.510
Bye bye!

00:09:01.550 --> 00:09:05.110
I can't believe that happened during your past.

00:09:05.910 --> 00:09:10.200
Yeah.  But I don't remember a thing.

00:09:10.200 --> 00:09:13.220
Help us.  Help us!

00:09:15.680 --> 00:09:17.130
What's up, Yugi?

00:09:17.130 --> 00:09:19.680
I heard someone ask for help.

00:09:20.860 --> 00:09:22.620
There's no one around.

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:23.930
But...

00:09:24.660 --> 00:09:26.970
You must be tired, Yugi.

00:09:26.970 --> 00:09:28.420
Let's go home.

00:09:28.910 --> 00:09:33.820
Good idea.  The Professor's story made me depressed.

00:09:45.750 --> 00:09:47.260
Can't sleep?

00:09:49.750 --> 00:09:51.540
My other self...

00:09:51.540 --> 00:09:55.070
Yeah.  There's a lot on my mind.

00:09:55.320 --> 00:09:57.310
Same here, partner.

00:09:57.310 --> 00:10:04.070
Is there a connection between my lost memories and what's happening now?

00:10:21.650 --> 00:10:25.470
Don't underestimate the Nameless Pharaoh's power.

00:10:25.900 --> 00:10:27.580
My apologies.

00:10:27.580 --> 00:10:29.980
But we took the God Cards.

00:10:38.100 --> 00:10:43.180
I can feel the mighty power inside these cards.

00:10:46.720 --> 00:10:53.190
This power shouldn't be used to restore the Pharaoh's memories.

00:10:53.400 --> 00:10:56.930
They're the key to unlocking the door.

00:10:58.080 --> 00:11:03.400
By offering these three cards to open the sealed door...

00:11:04.040 --> 00:11:07.660
Our god will breathe again.

00:11:09.840 --> 00:11:16.250
Our noble god, we offer you the power of these three Gods.

00:11:16.460 --> 00:11:21.920
Use their great power to open the door between our lands!

00:11:36.970 --> 00:11:39.980
The forbidden door is now open.

00:11:45.580 --> 00:11:46.890
Help us!

00:11:56.000 --> 00:11:57.330
Partner.

00:11:58.090 --> 00:12:00.330
My other self.

00:12:14.180 --> 00:12:16.780
Help us!

00:12:16.780 --> 00:12:18.220
Where's it coming from?

00:12:18.220 --> 00:12:19.370
This way!

00:12:22.650 --> 00:12:25.480
Someone got lost in here.

00:12:25.480 --> 00:12:26.620
Help us!

00:12:27.830 --> 00:12:29.620
My other self.

00:12:29.620 --> 00:12:31.410
Let's split up and find her.

00:12:44.250 --> 00:12:45.780
Did you find her?

00:12:45.780 --> 00:12:46.800
No.

00:12:47.160 --> 00:12:49.130
Where is she?

00:12:51.300 --> 00:12:52.370
Kuriboh!

00:12:52.370 --> 00:12:53.780
Why are you here?

00:12:56.040 --> 00:12:59.020
Kuriboh wants us to follow.

00:12:59.020 --> 00:13:00.160
Let's go, partner!

00:13:00.170 --> 00:13:00.660
Right!

00:13:11.160 --> 00:13:12.550
Kuriboh!

00:13:27.820 --> 00:13:30.580
I never knew this place existed in here.

00:13:31.020 --> 00:13:33.790
Help us!

00:13:35.730 --> 00:13:36.930
Help us!

00:13:57.290 --> 00:13:58.440
Where are we?

00:14:06.390 --> 00:14:08.090
Partner, look.

00:14:20.150 --> 00:14:21.390
What's that?

00:14:36.960 --> 00:14:38.920
Three dragons?

00:14:50.780 --> 00:14:53.480
Masters!  The chosen duelists!

00:14:56.560 --> 00:14:58.040
You came!

00:14:58.720 --> 00:15:00.530
Dark Magician Girl?

00:15:00.820 --> 00:15:02.880
You're the one who called us?

00:15:03.420 --> 00:15:09.400
Yes.  Our world and your world are facing annihilation.

00:15:09.690 --> 00:15:11.180
What?

00:15:11.180 --> 00:15:13.820
Tell us what's happening!

00:15:14.840 --> 00:15:21.170
The thoughts of the people in your world have created this world.

00:15:21.170 --> 00:15:23.830
A world of thought energy.

00:15:24.290 --> 00:15:29.840
But your world also depends on our world.

00:15:29.840 --> 00:15:33.340
Our two worlds are inseparable.

00:15:33.580 --> 00:15:39.120
But someone is trying to destroy the balance between our two worlds.

00:15:40.020 --> 00:15:43.080
A dark sun suddenly appeared in this world.

00:15:43.080 --> 00:15:47.680
It swallowed most of our friends.

00:15:49.150 --> 00:15:50.730
We're the only ones left.

00:16:03.130 --> 00:16:04.320
Partner...

00:16:04.320 --> 00:16:08.980
Is there a way to save this world and ours?

00:16:13.660 --> 00:16:18.920
These dragons have protected the world of Duel Monsters since ancient times.

00:16:19.300 --> 00:16:24.420
They used up all their power in past battles, so they're asleep.

00:16:24.640 --> 00:16:30.160
No one knows their names nor how long they've been here.

00:16:30.800 --> 00:16:32.650
Nameless dragons...

00:16:35.260 --> 00:16:39.850
Only a legend remains about these dragons.

00:16:39.850 --> 00:16:41.040
A legend?

00:16:41.440 --> 00:16:47.600
Yes.  When our world and your world face annihilation...

00:16:47.600 --> 00:16:51.050
...only a true duelist can heal the dragons' wounds.

00:16:51.560 --> 00:16:53.990
Only a true duelist...

00:16:53.990 --> 00:16:58.490
Master, I believe you can heal the dragons' wounds!

00:17:02.140 --> 00:17:03.310
Partner!

00:17:03.310 --> 00:17:04.180
Right!

00:17:25.940 --> 00:17:28.290
Look!  The statue is...

00:17:40.330 --> 00:17:42.010
My other self!

00:17:42.010 --> 00:17:43.170
Yeah.

00:17:43.170 --> 00:17:44.840
Nameless dragon!

00:17:44.840 --> 00:17:47.170
We know your name!

00:17:47.380 --> 00:17:48.670
Your name is...

00:17:49.220 --> 00:17:50.410
Timaeus!

00:17:54.750 --> 00:17:56.120
I sense it.

00:17:56.120 --> 00:18:01.420
Eye of Timaeus can awaken the dormant power of all monsters.

00:18:01.650 --> 00:18:03.920
Master!  Use its power!

00:18:27.720 --> 00:18:29.780
Huh?  An aurora?

00:18:36.700 --> 00:18:38.080
Grandpa!

00:18:38.080 --> 00:18:40.590
What's going on?

00:18:41.310 --> 00:18:42.760
I'll check it out!

00:18:42.760 --> 00:18:43.600
Yugi!

00:18:54.620 --> 00:18:55.170
Yugi!

00:18:55.170 --> 00:18:56.480
What's happening?

00:18:58.430 --> 00:19:00.120
What?

00:19:02.480 --> 00:19:03.860
What's that?

00:19:17.850 --> 00:19:19.270
Something emerged!

00:19:22.620 --> 00:19:24.270
Nameless Pharaoh.

00:19:24.810 --> 00:19:28.480
I'll sacrifice you to resurrect our god!

00:19:33.250 --> 00:19:34.190
Watch out!

00:19:34.190 --> 00:19:34.910
Run!

00:19:37.770 --> 00:19:38.530
Yugi!

00:19:38.530 --> 00:19:39.570
Run!

00:19:52.740 --> 00:19:55.270
It wasn't a dream!

00:19:55.900 --> 00:19:58.500
Lend me your strength, Timaeus!

00:20:08.360 --> 00:20:10.050
What's that dragon?

00:20:10.400 --> 00:20:11.800
Timaeus!

00:21:06.240 --> 00:21:07.910
Timaeus...

00:21:10.490 --> 00:21:12.240
Thank you, Master.

00:21:14.270 --> 00:21:18.200
We can now close the door.

00:21:18.200 --> 00:21:22.650
But the evil power has already escaped into this world.

00:21:22.650 --> 00:21:25.990
And my friends are still captured.

00:21:26.540 --> 00:21:27.730
That means...

00:21:28.140 --> 00:21:30.440
The evil god will resurrect.

00:21:30.440 --> 00:21:32.650
Master!  You must defeat the evil god!

00:21:32.650 --> 00:21:36.740
Or our two worlds will be destroyed!

00:21:49.360 --> 00:21:50.740
This is...

00:21:50.960 --> 00:21:53.680
...the power she left for us.

00:22:01.110 --> 00:22:10.020
The streets flow by, colored in red

00:22:10.520 --> 00:22:18.360
If you notice your pain, it changes to joy

00:22:20.090 --> 00:22:29.520
People learn of friendship every time they wipe their tears

00:22:30.140 --> 00:22:39.040
With the warm strength you gave me, I'll change them into kindness

00:22:39.610 --> 00:22:48.070
My overflowing emotions don't stop

00:22:48.850 --> 00:22:53.580
I'll live feeling them

00:22:54.190 --> 00:22:58.760
For me to be me

00:22:58.760 --> 00:23:07.220
Overflowing friendship heals me

00:23:07.900 --> 00:23:12.860
Our chance meeting was real

00:23:13.380 --> 00:23:22.520
We'll both understand that someday

00:23:28.800 --> 00:23:32.170
A giant eyeball appeared in the night sky.

00:23:32.170 --> 00:23:37.200
Is that Professor Hopkins's monster that destroyed an ancient civilization?

00:23:37.200 --> 00:23:43.020
Yugi repelled it using the legendary monster from the world of Duel Monsters.

00:23:43.020 --> 00:23:45.610
But the danger isn't over.

00:23:45.610 --> 00:23:48.620
That's when Yugi received a video message.

00:23:48.620 --> 00:23:52.160
The sender is... Pegasus?

00:23:52.160 --> 00:23:54.890
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Pegasus's Invitation

00:23:54.890 --> 00:23:56.400
Duel, standby!
